<title>HONG KONG: USI Holdings 1996 net up 12.79 percent.</title>
<headline>USI Holdings 1996 net up 12.79 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   17.0    vs  18.8 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.0     vs  0.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil     vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    63.5    vs  56.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,614.1 vs  1,479.2</p>
<p>    Company name		 USI Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 19-26</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   July 3</p>
<p>NOTE - USI Holdings is a garment manufacturer.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings has been adjusted for the effects of share consolidation in June 1996 and rights issue in November 1996.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is three H.K. cents (including interim dividend of one cent).</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
